{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:29:39+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sprite Forge", "steam_appid": 2476950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/9ce2da9f15efcd5140f301eda847f52e.gif?t=1793537502\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/9ce2da9f15efcd5140f301eda847f52e.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>Turn a sketch into a sprite set<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/9ce2da9f15efcd5140f301eda847f52e.gif?t=1793537502\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/9ce2da9f15efcd5140f301eda847f52e.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprite Forge combines a pixel-art editor with procedural generators. Start with your drawing, choose a palette and settings, and generate variations or complete asset sets. Keep the useful results, then refine them pixel by pixel as layers and animation frames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/20f5d4fd873e32d5bfee19f8784e8073.avif?t=1793537502\" width=64 height=64 /></span>From idea to game assets <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/d18cc7fd9f9d920565668697a0d7c09a.avif?t=1793537502\" width=64 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/db060ebc67d3d2df36ce590cf98bf07b.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span>  Draw a silhouette or open a starting preset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/395cb51efbe30f125dac3b99e5bee874.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> Choose a generator, palette, and settings. Reuse a seed to reproduce a result.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/db060ebc67d3d2df36ce590cf98bf07b.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> Generate variations or a set, then save the picks you want to keep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/395cb51efbe30f125dac3b99e5bee874.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> Edit the result with the drawing tools, layers, and timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/db060ebc67d3d2df36ce590cf98bf07b.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> Export PNGs, GIFs, sprite sheets, tilesets, or an atlas for your engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/b5026184a1ed7deb04325b89a1a797d7.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/b5026184a1ed7deb04325b89a1a797d7.webm?t=1793537502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Generators for common game art<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/d1ce40b0f86c62a1fa2eaf200281d559.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/d1ce40b0f86c62a1fa2eaf200281d559.webm?t=1793537502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/031aa56a9591cbb4105787fe12824067.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>Characters:</strong> Build people, animals, and monsters from parts. Create directional and animated sets from presets or your own starting shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/0a096959df326ad56b60bdae5f09308c.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>Effects and materials:</strong> Generate fire, magic, combat effects, and material looks such as wood, stone, metal, and glass. Apply them to your drawing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/14ebf95c74bae9d25b0b3f243affaacd.avif?t=1793537502\" width=320 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/031aa56a9591cbb4105787fe12824067.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>Furniture:</strong> Create beds, chairs, tables, sofas, cabinets, doors, and shelves in top-down or side-view styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/0a096959df326ad56b60bdae5f09308c.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>UI components:</strong> Make buttons, panels, sliders, toggles, and other components with four visual states and 9-slice support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Tiles and procedural shapes:</strong> Create seamless repeating textures or generate noise-based shapes, on their own or over your drawing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/6d8395a2ee26044317c25781b3db23a0.avif?t=1793537502\" width=256 height=192 /></span>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/634eb83014159be3a38a3d0e009c169d.avif?t=1793537502\" width=256 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/339ba01ea6be660f715c99df0fe19f96.webp?t=1793537502\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/339ba01ea6be660f715c99df0fe19f96.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span>Edit and animate in the same app<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/05e9f15d4cff500b7f0e459535bb2088.apng?t=1793537502\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/05e9f15d4cff500b7f0e459535bb2088.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use drawing and selection tools, palettes, layers, groups, masks, frames, and named animations. Preview motion with onion skinning, keep symmetry while drawing, and save generator results with their settings in your library.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/86ae172a39686c33ed73dd77f31888f8.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/86ae172a39686c33ed73dd77f31888f8.webm?t=1793537502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Export to your workflow<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/4d49f3e6e26f9ac1036598183c122089.apng?t=1793537502\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/4d49f3e6e26f9ac1036598183c122089.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/031aa56a9591cbb4105787fe12824067.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> PNG, sprite sheets, tilesets, animated GIF, and CSS box-shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/4003334a0569cae93126d50b4ced4be8.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Atlas and JSON export for <strong>Unity</strong>, <strong>Godot</strong>, and <strong>Phaser</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/031aa56a9591cbb4105787fe12824067.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> Import and export <strong>.aseprite</strong> files with layers, frames, and tags.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/10d2be73d5f019868556b148aabdf135.webp?t=1793537502\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/10d2be73d5f019868556b148aabdf135.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span>Turn an image into pixel art<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/e43c3c28d1fba7efe1fdb050d39ffbee.webp?t=1793537502\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/e43c3c28d1fba7efe1fdb050d39ffbee.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert a soft-edged or pseudo-pixel image into crisp pixel art. Sprite Forge detects the source grid, aligns the blocks, and reduces the palette locally. Save the result as a PNG, add it as a frame, or create a document from it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/d1ce40b0f86c62a1fa2eaf200281d559.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/d1ce40b0f86c62a1fa2eaf200281d559.webm?t=1793537502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Learn as you work<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/7a5896bc2e5fcd18c0d0161278348503.apng?t=1793537502\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/7a5896bc2e5fcd18c0d0161278348503.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" class=\"bb_img\" wi