img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/d1ce40b0f86c62a1fa2eaf200281d559.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/d1ce40b0f86c62a1fa2eaf200281d559.webm?t=1793537502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/031aa56a9591cbb4105787fe12824067.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>Characters:</strong> Build people, animals, and monsters from parts. Create directional and animated sets from presets or your own starting shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/0a096959df326ad56b60bdae5f09308c.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>Effects and materials:</strong> Generate fire, magic, combat effects, and material looks such as wood, stone, metal, and glass. Apply them to your drawing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/14ebf95c74bae9d25b0b3f243affaacd.avif?t=1793537502\" width=320 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/031aa56a9591cbb4105787fe12824067.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>Furniture:</strong> Create beds, chairs, tables, sofas, cabinets, doors, and shelves in top-down or side-view styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/0a096959df326ad56b60bdae5f09308c.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>UI components:</strong> Make buttons, panels, sliders, toggles, and other components with four visual states and 9-slice support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Tiles and procedural shapes:</strong> Create seamless repeating textures or generate noise-based shapes, on their own or over your drawing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/6d8395a2ee26044317c25781b3db23a0.avif?t=1793537502\" width=256 height=192 /></span>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/634eb83014159be3a38a3d0e009c169d.avif?t=1793537502\" width=256 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/339ba01ea6be660f715c99df0fe19f96.webp?t=1793537502\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/339ba01ea6be660f715c99df0fe19f96.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span>Edit and animate in the same app<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/05e9f15d4cff500b7f0e459535bb2088.apng?t=1793537502\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/05e9f15d4cff500b7f0e459535bb2088.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use drawing and selection tools, palettes, layers, groups, masks, frames, and named animations. Preview motion with onion skinning, keep symmetry while drawing, and save generator results with their settings in your library.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/86ae172a39686c33ed73dd77f31888f8.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/86ae172a39686c33ed73dd77f31888f8.webm?t=1793537502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Export to your workflow<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/4d49f3e6e26f9ac1036598183c122089.apng?t=1793537502\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/4d49f3e6e26f9ac1036598183c122089.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/031aa56a9591cbb4105787fe12824067.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> PNG, sprite sheets, tilesets, animated GIF, and CSS box-shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/4003334a0569cae93126d50b4ced4be8.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Atlas and JSON export for <strong>Unity</strong>, <strong>Godot</strong>, and <strong>Phaser</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/031aa56a9591cbb4105787fe12824067.webp?t=1793537502\" width=32 height=32 /></span> Import and export <strong>.aseprite</strong> files with layers, frames, and tags.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/10d2be73d5f019868556b148aabdf135.webp?t=1793537502\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/10d2be73d5f019868556b148aabdf135.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span>Turn an image into pixel art<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/e43c3c28d1fba7efe1fdb050d39ffbee.webp?t=1793537502\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/e43c3c28d1fba7efe1fdb050d39ffbee.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert a soft-edged or pseudo-pixel image into crisp pixel art. Sprite Forge detects the source grid, aligns the blocks, and reduces the palette locally. Save the result as a PNG, add it as a frame, or create a document from it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/d1ce40b0f86c62a1fa2eaf200281d559.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/d1ce40b0f86c62a1fa2eaf200281d559.webm?t=1793537502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Learn as you work<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/7a5896bc2e5fcd18c0d0161278348503.apng?t=1793537502\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/extras/7a5896bc2e5fcd18c0d0161278348503.poster.avif?t=1793537502\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive quick tour and full documentation are available in the app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Create amazing sprites for your project. Your beautiful tile map in a couple of minutes. Simplify your life, automate the generation of beautiful sprites.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/b08b8cceaea0c5c132ae794a22acc1ffb230d77f/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1793537502", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/73217f093ce56e63556c0f30d65097d19ee1ccfd/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1793537502", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476950/73217f093ce56e63556c0f30d65097d19ee1ccfd/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1793537502", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (with Aero), 8.1, 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.7 GHz Processor or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 720<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Intel i7 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1030<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.9<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:<